    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Deals on Four Wheels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of running your own dealership? In <i>Deal On Four Wheels</i>, you don\u2019t just buy and sell vehicles\u2014you customize them to meet the demands of the most demanding clients! From luxury models to high-performance sports cars, every deal could turn into a goldmine\u2026 if you play your cards right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/461f4654fff1e5931aba95f626a6c5c2.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Diverse Clients, Unique Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all customers are the same! An influencer wants a flashy ride to impress their followers, a VIP seeks exclusivity, while an everyday client has more practical needs. Meet their demands, earn stellar reviews, and build your reputation in the industry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/55d3dd2917cf46b271b633f313893444.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade, Customize, Progress!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more deals you close, the more your name rises to the top! As you level up and gain reputation, you'll unlock new cars, upgrades, and exclusive customization options. Create one-of-a-kind vehicles and become the go-to dealer for those seeking the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/95b181566b5b6ddb4516f2a760b88868.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Relax or Ruin? The Choice is Yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of wheeling and dealing, it\u2019s time to unwind! Spend your earnings on luxury homes or kick back at the bar with a cold beer. And if you're feeling lucky, try your hand at blackjack\u2026 but be careful not to lose it all in one bad hand! Will you rise to the top as the ultimate car dealer, or will fortune turn against you? The road to success is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/39ce52851d0dbb629e606a6b725cb7e9.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Deals on Four Wheels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of running your own dealership? In <i>Deal On Four Wheels</i>, you don\u2019t just buy and sell vehicles\u2014you customize them to meet the demands of the most demanding clients! From luxury models to high-performance sports cars, every deal could turn into a goldmine\u2026 if you play your cards right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/461f4654fff1e5931aba95f626a6c5c2.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Diverse Clients, Unique Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all customers are the same! An influencer wants a flashy ride to impress their followers, a VIP seeks exclusivity, while an everyday client has more practical needs. Meet their demands, earn stellar reviews, and build your reputation in the industry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/55d3dd2917cf46b271b633f313893444.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade, Customize, Progress!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more deals you close, the more your name rises to the top! As you level up and gain reputation, you'll unlock new cars, upgrades, and exclusive customization options. Create one-of-a-kind vehicles and become the go-to dealer for those seeking the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/95b181566b5b6ddb4516f2a760b88868.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Relax or Ruin? The Choice is Yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of wheeling and dealing, it\u2019s time to unwind! Spend your earnings on luxury homes or kick back at the bar with a cold beer. And if you're feeling lucky, try your hand at blackjack\u2026 but be careful not to lose it all in one bad hand! Will you rise to the top as the ultimate car dealer, or will fortune turn against you? The road to success is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528480/extras/39ce52851d0dbb629e606a6b725cb7e9.avif?t=1749132407\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Manage your office, buy and customize vehicles on demand for a diverse clientele, from influencers to car enthusiasts! The more clients you satisfy, the more money and reputation you earn. Unlock new suppliers, invest in properties, and unwind with a game of blackjack!",
